<figure id="S6.F4" class="ltx_figure">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F4.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 4</span>. </span><span id="S6.F4.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S6.F4.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Comparison between a real hypergraph and those generated by HyperLLM with different attachment probabilities.</span> The results, particularly for preferential attachment probability 0.85, closely mimic the real data patterns.
</span></figcaption>
<div id="S6.F4.6" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:573.6pt;height:261.9pt;vertical-align:-128.9pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-63.0pt,28.7pt) scale(0.8,0.8) ;">
<table id="S6.F4.6.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
