<div id="S6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In this section, we conduct a comprehensive experimental evaluation to validate the effectiveness of our HyperLLM framework. We first compare its performance against state-of-the-art baselines in fitting real-world hypergraph structures. We then analyze the sensitivity of its key hyperparameters to demonstrate its robustness.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S6.F5" class="ltx_figure">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F5.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 5</span>. </span><span id="S6.F5.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="S6.F5.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Hyperparameter sensitivity analysis of HyperLLM.</span> The plots show performance on four datasets: (a) Email-Eu-core, (b) coauth-Geo, (c) DAWN, and (d) NDC-substances. The z-axis (<math id="S6.F5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>) measures goodness of fit (<math id="S6.F5.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\gamma" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>γ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\gamma</annotation></semantics></math>, defined in Eq. <a href="#S6.E9" title="In 6.2. Hyperparameter Sensitivity ‣ 6. Experiments ‣ Modeling Hypergraph Using Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a>); higher is better.
</span></figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
<figure id="S6.F5.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.11728v1/email_3d.png" id="S6.F5.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/455;" width="476" height="455" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F5.sf1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(a)</span> </span><span id="S6.F5.sf1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Email-Eu-core</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
<figure id="S6.F5.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><img src="2510.11728v1/coa_Geo_3d.png" id="S6.F5.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/455;" width="476" height="455" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S6.F5.sf2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">(b)</span> </span><span id="S6.F5.sf2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">coauth-Geo</span></figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_4">
